[00:30.82]
[00:30.87] I wish that straight and narrow wasn't so damn hard to walk
[00:30.87] 多希望坦途不再如此艰难
[00:35.97] And I could call the man upstairs every time I need to talk
[00:35.97] 能在需要时随时与上天交谈
